    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Providing or revoking access is typically a two-step process: a) establishing and authorizing an identity for the user or system; b) granting access rights to that identity. Not all persons who require an identity need access rights."
