    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "When composing an information security awareness, education and training programme, it is important to not only focus on the 'what' and 'how', but also the 'why', where possible. It is important that personnel understand the aim of information security and the potential effect, positive and negative, on the organization of their own behaviour."
      }
    ],
